899
01:24:42,327 --> 01:24:43,786
We have a. . .
ພວກເຮົາມີ...

900
01:24:55,174 --> 01:24:56,257
Sybok.
Sybok.

901
01:25:00,429 --> 01:25:01,846
Perhaps. . .
ບາງທີ...

902
01:27:17,983 --> 01:27:23,112
Brave sou¡s, we¡come.
